    "text": "<p>Among the following, the aromatic compounds are :</p><p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 8pt\"><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/57b73af2-a95e-4219-b046-7cfae0578dfe-image.png\" style=\"width: 325px; height: 159px;\" /></p><p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 8pt\">Choose the correct answer from the following options :</p>",
